{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And your threshing shall overtake.</b> etc. Just as you are constantly engaged in keeping My commandments without neglect, so your blessing will be without neglect and without interruption between one blessing and the next." "<b>And you shall dwell securely in your land.</b> Above, in the section of בהר, it is written: וישבתם על הארץ לבטח. He returned here and illuminated his words and added and said: בארצכם — in the land that is yours. But in years of famine, people are exiled, as it is said: לא תוסף תת כוחה לך, נע ונד תהיה בארץ. And it says: נודד ללחם איה."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:23.868591541Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}